   "design": "Versioned scripts download election and survey files, clean and merge them and produce the standard tables and charts, instead of spreadsheet work by hand. Open answers are coded to a fixed codebook by a model with a confidence mark; the political scientist double-codes a sample and every low-confidence answer, and a batch is released only above the agreed agreement rate. Analysis, interpretation, the report, discussion and mail stay with the political scientist; no model writes numbers into the report.",
